<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκῡρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cancel, set aside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήφισμα,
				δόγμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				1.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				16.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφειλήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					742.30
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			, Ephesus), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.4.10
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1053 ii 14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>set at naught, treat as of no effect</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt;<i><span class="en">
				<u>Es.</u>
				6.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγον θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					15.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.8.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>reject, deny the validity of</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>render powerless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ λογισμῷ τὸν τῶν παθῶν οἶστρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ma.</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
